    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Fintan Cahill Auctioneers are delighted to present this superbly renovated detached bungalow to the market, ideally situated in the highly sought-after Beckscourt Lawns development in Bailieborough. \r\n\r\nNestled within a small and peaceful residential estate of just a handful of homes, this property enjoys a prime location within walking distance of the town centre and all local amenities, offering the perfect balance of privacy and convenience.\r\n\r\nThis beautifully modernised home has been thoughtfully finished throughout and is presented in excellent turnkey condition. Internally, the accommodation is both spacious and versatile, designed to suit the needs of modern family living. \r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a contemporary fitted kitchen with ample storage and workspace, flowing seamlessly into the welcoming living room. This cosy yet bright space features a solid fuel stove and double doors opening directly onto the rear garden, allowing for plenty of natural light and easy indoor-outdoor living.\r\n\r\nThere are four bedrooms, one of which is en-suite.\r\n\r\nAdditional accommodation includes a guest WC, a fully fitted utility room, a modern family bathroom, and a separate office/playroom, ideal for those working from home or in need of extra family space.\r\n\r\nFinished throughout in a tasteful neutral palette, the property offers a fresh and elegant interior that will appeal to a wide range of buyers. The home has been carefully maintained and upgraded to a high standard, making it ready for immediate occupation.\r\n\r\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a stylish and spacious home in a quiet residential setting, just minutes from the heart of Bailieborough. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
